<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
Hardened runtime exceptions for every signed macOS binary.

disable-library-validation: the hardened runtime refuses a dylib signed by
another Team ID. macFUSE's libfuse.2.dylib is signed by its author, so
without this entitlement dlopen fails on every Mac with SIP on, cgofuse
panics with "cannot find FUSE", and the app dies with SIGABRT on the first
teleport connect (issue #241, 2026-10-20). A Mac with SIP off does not
enforce library validation, which is why the development machine never
showed it.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>com.apple.security.cs.disable-library-validation</key>
	<true/>
</dict>
</plist>
